<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 88 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 88 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to January 8 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to December 31 SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 36,485	 36,397</p>
<p> Money market intervention    12,595	 11,626</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,906	  1,906</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,265	  2,266</p>
<p> Total assets		     59,495	 58,518</p>
<p>In the previous week to December 31 reserves rose by two million markka. @</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
